Miss Fortune, the renowned as the Pirate Queen of Bilgewater. Miss Fortune is an infamous bounty hunter and the captain of "The Syren". Miss Fortune seems untouchable from the way she carries herself, but she is deeply scarred despite her tough façade.

A Bilgewater Crest icon Bilgewater captain famed for her looks but feared for her ruthlessness, Sarah Fortune paints a stark figure among the hardened criminals of the port city. As a child, she witnessed the reaver king Gangplank murder her family—an act she brutally avenged years later, blowing up his flagship while he was still aboard. Those who underestimate her will face a beguiling and unpredictable opponent... and, likely, a bullet or two in their guts.

Now only those closest to Sarah call her by that name. To anybody else, her name is Miss Fortune. She is strong and stern, but also flirtatious and playful when she wants to be. She's always on the lookout for exceptional individuals to join her crew aboard The Syren.
